---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="How Ethotechnics works" description="How Ethotechnics works.">
  <section class="stack-lg institute-screen">
    <h1>How Ethotechnics works</h1>
    <p>
      Ethotechnics governs system failure, not intent.<br /><br />
      It provides operational artifacts that make decisions reversible, assign ownership under
      pressure, and cap the burden placed on affected users.<br /><br />
      If you need adoptable defaults, use the Institute. If you need installation, rehearsal, or
      binding enforcement, use the Studio.
    </p>
    <div class="actions">
      <a class="button primary" href="/#failure-intake">Start with a failure</a>
      <a class="button" href="/artifacts">Browse artifacts</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
